msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-cookie-consent"

msgid ""
"Free, multilingual, fully configurable cookie consent banner — GDPR/ePrivacy"
" and Google Consent Mode v2 ready, with no pageview limits."
msgstr ""
"Gratis, flerspråkig och helt anpassningsbar cookie-banner — GDPR/ePrivacy "
"och Google Consent Mode v2 redo, utan sidvisningsbegränsningar."

msgid "Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbro"

msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Bildoptimerare"

msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Konvertera till WebP och AVIF, anpassa för stora bilder och ladda in dem vid"
" behov — allt på din egen server."

msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "AI Studio"

msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no"
" credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Skriv och illustrera inlägg med AI via din egen OpenAI-nyckel — till "
"självkostnadspris, utan mellanhänder."

