msgstr "SEO"

msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"Enkel SEO med gratis LocalBusiness-schema, sitemaps och sociala kort. Ingen "
"data skickas ut."

msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "SMTP-utskick"

msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"WordPress-e-post via din egen SMTP-server — med e-postlogg, återutsändning, "
"reservanslutning och felvarningar."

